
[{"content":" Welcome to My Obsidian Auto Publisher project # Morning visitors! This is my blog website where I publish my thoughts and ideas/describe the videos and fiction I enjoy/technologies I discovered.\nContents # About\nFeel free to explore the sections above to discover more.\n","date":"26 August 2025","externalUrl":null,"permalink":"/ProgressDoc/","section":"","summary":"\u003ch1 class=\"relative group\"\u003eWelcome to My Obsidian Auto Publisher project \n    \u003cdiv id=\"welcome-to-my-obsidian-auto-publisher-project\" class=\"anchor\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n    \n    \u003cspan\n        class=\"absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none\"\u003e\n        \u003ca class=\"group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700 !no-underline\" href=\"#welcome-to-my-obsidian-auto-publisher-project\" aria-label=\"Anchor\"\u003e#\u003c/a\u003e\n    \u003c/span\u003e        \n    \n\u003c/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMorning visitors! This is my blog website where I publish my thoughts and ideas/describe the videos and fiction I enjoy/technologies I discovered.\u003c/p\u003e","title":"","type":"page"},{"content":"Initially this project was developed by Youtuber Network Chuck in his video I started a blog\u0026hellip;..in 2024 (why you should too). Watching his video inspired me to make my own version to further explore and expand upon the ideas presented.\nPurpose # Hopefully, this project will serve as a vital resource for me to facilitate the blog writing process and free me from my procrastination.\nAuthor contacts # Full Name: Nurasyl Serikov\nContact: nurasylserikov4@gmail.com\nGitHub: nurik125/Hugo-blog-site\nLicense # This project is licensed under the MIT License.\n","date":"26 August 2025","externalUrl":null,"permalink":"/ProgressDoc/about/","section":"","summary":"About this project","title":"About","type":"page"},{"content":"#day_one\nSetting up hugo blog post # First inta